    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταέννῡμι</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-εινύω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 Verb, not found in the form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθέννυμι</span> because of the digamma, only in impf.,
			aor.
		
			Act.
		, and pf.
		
			Pass.
		:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clothe,
				cover</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριξὶ δὲ πάντα νέκυν
