				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είνυον</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.135
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηοὺς αἵματι καπνῷ τε . . κατείνυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.673
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρος καταειμένον ὕλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.351
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				19.431
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
